<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
<%@ include file="head.jspf" %>
<c:set var="owner" value="${record.owner_id == actorId}"/><c:set var="editable" value="${owner and not record.deleted and (record.status == 'DRAFT' or record.status == 'REJECTED')}"/>
<p class="demo-note">데모 예시 · <c:out value="${reportType.formula}"/></p><c:if test="${record.deleted}"><div class="alert">휴지통에 보관 중입니다. 명세와 이력은 유지되며 복구 후 수정할 수 있습니다.</div></c:if>
<section class="panel"><div class="section-title"><h2><c:out value="${record.title}"/></h2><span class="badge"><c:out value="${labels[record.status]}"/> · v${record.version}</span></div><div class="metadata"><span>관리 단위 <b><c:out value="${record.business_unit}"/></b></span><span>기간 <b><c:out value="${record.period_start}"/> ~ <c:out value="${record.period_end}"/></b></span><span>표시 통화 <b>${record.currency}</b></span><span>작성자 <b><c:out value="${record.owner_name}"/></b></span><span>검토자 <b><c:out value="${record.reviewer_name}"/></b></span></div><p class="pre"><c:out value="${record.summary_note}"/></p><c:if test="${not empty record.source_id}"><p class="muted">원본 보고서 #${record.source_id}에서 생성한 사본입니다. 원본은 변경되지 않습니다.</p></c:if>
<div class="report-kpis"><div><small>계산 결과 (${reportType.family == 'CONTROL' ? '완료율 %' : reportType.family == 'OPERATION' ? '최고 잔여점수' : record.currency})</small><strong id="report-result"><c:out value="${totals.display}"/></strong></div><div><small>주의 명세</small><strong>${totals.alerts}건</strong></div></div>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th><c:out value="${reportType.dimension}"/></th><th>분류</th><c:forEach items="${reportType.columns}" var="col"><th><c:out value="${col}"/></th></c:forEach><th>계산 결과</th><th>근거·증빙 메모</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${lines}" var="line"><tr class="${line.alert ? 'attention-row' : ''}"><td><c:out value="${line.label}"/></td><td><c:out value="${line.category}"/></td><td><c:out value="${line.amount_a}"/></td><td><c:out value="${line.amount_b}"/></td><td><c:out value="${line.amount_c}"/></td><td><c:out value="${line.metric}"/><c:if test="${line.alert}"><small>주의 항목</small></c:if></td><td class="pre"><c:out value="${line.memo}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">계산은 소수 4자리까지 HALF_UP, 표시는 2자리입니다. 운영위험 12점 이상·채권 90일 이상 미회수·통제 예외·음수 잔액을 주의 항목으로 표시합니다. 명세의 비율·기간을 금액과 합산하지 않습니다.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button" href="${ctx}/reports/${reportType.code}">목록</a><c:if test="${editable}"><a class="button primary" href="${ctx}/reports/${reportType.code}/edit?id=${record.id}">보고서·명세 수정</a></c:if></div></section>
<c:if test="${not record.deleted and (editable or (owner and record.status == 'PENDING') or (record.reviewer_id == actorId and manager and record.status == 'PENDING'))}"><section class="panel"><h2>검토·승인 처리</h2><form method="post" action="${ctx}/reports/${reportType.code}/${record.id}/transition"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="${record.version}"><label>처리 의견 (승인·반려·회수·삭제 시 필수)<textarea name="note" maxlength="1000" rows="2"></textarea></label><div class="actions"><c:if test="${owner and record.status == 'DRAFT'}"><button class="primary" name="action" value="submit">검토 상신</button></c:if><c:if test="${owner and record.status == 'PENDING'}"><button name="action" value="withdraw">상신 회수</button></c:if><c:if test="${record.reviewer_id == actorId and manager and record.status == 'PENDING'}"><button class="primary" name="action" value="approve">승인 확정</button><button class="danger" name="action" value="reject">반려</button></c:if><c:if test="${editable}"><button class="danger" name="action" value="delete">초안 휴지통 이동</button></c:if></div></form><c:if test="${record.status == 'REJECTED'}"><p>반려 사유를 반영해 수정 저장한 뒤 다시 상신하세요.</p></c:if></section></c:if>
<c:if test="${record.deleted and (owner or admin)}"><form class="panel" method="post" action="${ctx}/reports/${reportType.code}/${record.id}/transition"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="${record.version}"><button name="action" value="restore" class="primary">초안 복구</button></form></c:if>
<c:if test="${not record.deleted}"><section class="panel"><h2>새 개정본 작성</h2><p>승인본은 수정·삭제할 수 없습니다. 원본과 명세를 보존하고 자신의 새 초안으로 복사하세요.</p><form class="copy-form" method="post" action="${ctx}/reports/${reportType.code}/${record.id}/copy"><input type="hidden" name="${_csrf.parameterName}" value="${_csrf.token}"><label>새 초안 검토자<select name="reviewer_id" required><option value="">선택하세요</option><c:forEach items="${reviewers}" var="u"><option value="${u.id}"><c:out value="${u.name}"/></option></c:forEach></select></label><button ${empty reviewers ? 'disabled' : ''}>사본 생성</button></form></section></c:if>
<section class="panel"><h2>변경·승인 이력</h2><p class="muted">최근 100건 표시 · 전체 이력은 보존하며 화면에서 수정·삭제할 수 없습니다.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>시각</th><th>사용자</th><th>처리</th><th>버전</th><th>의견</th></tr></thead><tbody><c:forEach items="${events}" var="event"><tr><td><c:out value="${event.created_at}"/></td><td><c:out value="${event.actor}"/></td><td><c:out value="${eventLabels[event.action]}"/></td><td>${event.report_version}</td><td class="pre"><c:out value="${event.note}"/></td></tr></c:forEach></tbody></table></div></section>
<%@ include file="foot.jspf" %>
